---
fixtures: [node]
---

// Like operator arguments of type `secret`, the key of `hmac` also accepts a
// plain string or blob.
from {value: "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog"}
digest = hmac(value, "key")
blob_digest = hmac(value, b"key")
assert digest == blob_digest
assert digest == hmac(value, secret("format-key"))
